%% Sequence Diagram for Parent Fund Management (Youth Account)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebApp as Banking Web Application
    participant API as Youth Account API Gateway
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Txn as Transaction Service
    participant DB as Youth Account DB

    Parent->>WebApp: Login & Authenticate (OAuth2)
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard
    API->>Account: Validate parent owns youth account
    Account-->>API: Ownership/Balance
    API->>DB: Fetch dashboard, limits
    DB-->>API: Dashboard data
    API->>Txn: Fetch recent transactions
    Txn-->>API: Recent transactions
    API-->>WebApp: Dashboard response
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display dashboard
    Note over API,Payment: For fund transfer:
    WebApp->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    API->>Account: Validate source account
    Account-->>API: Validation OK
    API->>Payment: Initiate transfer
    Payment-->>API: Transfer result
    API->>DB: Update youth account balance
    DB-->>API: Update OK
    API->>Txn: Log transaction
    Txn-->>API: Log OK
    API-->>WebApp: Transfer result
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transfer status
    Note over API,DB: For spending limit update:
    WebApp->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    API->>DB: Update spending limit
    DB-->>API: Update OK
    API->>Txn: Log limit change
    Txn-->>API: Log OK
    API-->>WebApp: Limit update result
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show limit status
    Note over API,Txn: For transaction history:
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    API->>Txn: Fetch transactions
    Txn-->>API: Transaction list
    API-->>WebApp: Transaction history
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display history
